{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Stop a otter managed running container environment {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop my-box{R}                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop --all{R}                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter stop --yes my-box{R}                            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}  ┆ {4}-a{R}  {5}Stop all otters{R}                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R} ┆ {4}-r{R}  {5}stop rootful containers{R}                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--yes{R}  ┆ {4}-Y{R}  {5}Stop without confirmation{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    ┆ {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--verbose{R} ┆ {4}-v{R}  {5}Show more verbose output{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}  {5}Prefer over 'sudo otter'.If you dont want{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         {5}to use 'sudo' for root escalation you can{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         {5}Set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM to use different app.{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Rootful containers need '--root' for 'stop' to work.{R}{2}│{R}
